[h2]Reporting a bug[/h2]
Press [b]Ctrl+Shift+B[/b] (or [b]Panels → Report a bug[/b]) the moment something goes wrong, say what happened in one line, and press [b]Send report[/b]. The report carries the position, the room's save, the coach's run log and the last lines of the logs (your Windows user name is removed), so the bug can be replayed exactly. Nothing is sent until you press Send. You get a link on your clipboard; paste it into a comment here or a GitHub issue. [b]Save to file only[/b] writes the same report to [i]%LOCALAPPDATA%\SpireMentor\bugreports\[/i] and sends nothing.

